{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0425.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "V. xxiii. ΚΙΝΝΑΒΑΡΕΩΣ ΣΚΕΥΑΣΙΑ"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0425.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "1]  ὑδραργύρου μέρη ε', καὶ θείου ζῶντος λελειωμένου ... 15 οὐροῦ καθαροῦ μέρος α', καὶ λαβὼν βικίον καθαρὸν δυνατόν, καὶ ἄνευ καπνοῦ τῶν δυνάμεων βεστάσαι τὴν πυράν, βάλε τὴν σκευὴν εἰς αὐτό · μὴ γέμει δέ, f. 232 v. ἀλλὰ μᾶλλον ἵνα ἔστι κενὸν ὅσον δάκτυλα δ' ἢ γ', καὶ ἀνάμιξον πάντα, καὶ ποίησον καμίνιον οἷον τοῦ ὑελόψου. Ἔστω δὲ τοιούτον βικίον εὐρύχωρον · καὶ ἄφες τόπον ὅσον θέλεις"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "εἰσελθεῖν τὸ βιχίον, καὶ γώρισον χάλαιμον · καὶ μετὰ ταῦτα ἄναψον τὸ"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "καμίνιον. Ἔασον δὲ καὶ ἑτέραν θυριδίτξαν μικρὰν ἔθεν μέλλει εἰσελθεῖν"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "τοῦ πυρὸς λάθρα κύκλωθεν. Τὸ δὲ σημεῖον τῆς ἐφήσεως τοιούτων ἐστι ·"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "τήρησον τὸ κένωμα τοῦ βιχίου, καὶ ἐὰν ἴδῃς ἐξερχόμενον καπνὸν ὥσεὶ"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "πορφύρας σχῆμα ἔχοντα, καὶ τὴν θερμότητα κινναβαρίζουσαν, ἰδοὺ"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.6", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "γέγονεν. Κατάλειπε πλέον τοῦ ἐκκαίειν τὸ ὕελιον · εἰ γὰρ τούτου γενο-"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "μένου πλέον ἐθέλεις ἐκκαύσαι, ρήγνυται τὸ ὕελιον."}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.8", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "2] Ὑδράργυρον βράσον μετὰ ξερανίνω ἐλαίω θείω τε, καὶ καυστὸν"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.9", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἀφένικον ἐν ἀγγείω ὕελίνω ἐπὶ ἡμέρας γʹ, τῇ δὲ δη ἡμέρᾳ ἔασον"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.10", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ψυγῆναι. Καὶ ἔστω πάλιν ὑδράργυρος μετὰ ὄξους δριμυτάτου · καὶ"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.11", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "λαβὼν θείου τὸ ἡμισυ κατὰ σταθμὸν τοῦ ἀργύρου, καὶ μίξας αὐτὰ ὁμοῦ"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.12", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἐν νίτρῳ, καὶ τρίψον αὐτὴν εἰς ἰγδὴν, καὶ γενήσεται ξανθὴ. Καὶ βαλὼν"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.13", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "αὐτὴν εἰς ἄγγος ὄξος δριμύτατον, καὶ σιμώσας καλῶς ἵνα μὴ διαπνεύσῃ,"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.14", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "καὶ ἔασον ἡμέρας εʹ · τῇ δὲ ζη ἡμέρᾳ εὑρήσεις τὸ μυστήριον. Γλύκιζε"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.15", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "αὐτήν, καὶ ξηράνας αὐτὴν ἐν ἡλίῳ, καὶ ἔχε τὸ μυστήριον."}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.16", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "3] Σὺν Θεῷ, λαβὼν ὠά, κλάσας αὐτά, καὶ γώρισον τὰ πυρρά, καὶ τὰ"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.17", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "λευκὰ ταῦτα παρίδε · καὶ θέσον εἰς ἄμβικον, καὶ ἔασον ἡμέρας ηʹ ἢ ζʹ ·"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.18", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "καὶ κάθολε ἀπʼ αὐτοῦ τὸ ὕδωρ · τὸ δὲ σωματούμενον καύσον μέχρι"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.kinnaba-rews-skeuasi-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327-fol", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0426.19", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "γίνεται ἢ ἀσθεστος, καὶ ἔχε ταύτην ἀκριβῶς πεφυλαγμένην. Αὐτὴ"}
